{"id":"tatsa_chlich","lemma":"tatsächlich","pos":"adv","rank":605,"glosses":["actually, really, indeed"],"ipa":"/taːtˈzɛçlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b9/De-at-tats%C3%A4chlich.ogg/De-at-tats%C3%A4chlich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das ist tatsächlich passiert.","en":"That actually happened.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758981","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Es funktioniert tatsächlich.","en":"It really works.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/102332","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to work, function","l":"funktionieren"},null]},{"text":"Hast du tatsächlich jemanden umgebracht?","en":"Did you actually kill someone?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"someone, somebody","l":"jemand"},{"g":"to kill","l":"umbringen"}]},{"text":"Wir haben den Unfall tatsächlich gesehen.","en":"We actually saw the accident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717873","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"accident"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}]},{"text":"Ich bin tatsächlich von hier.","en":"I'm from around here, actually.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"here"}]}]}